## 1. Fixed‑Window Counter (simplest)

| Data structure | Purpose |
|----------------|---------|
| `Map<userId, UserBucket>` | One entry per active user |
| `UserBucket` | Holds `windowStart` (epoch ms) and `count` (int) |

