| Scenario | Best approach |
|----------|---------------|
| Very low traffic, simplest code | Fixed‑window counter |
| Need smooth rate limiting | Token bucket |
| Precise control, small user base | Sliding‑window log |
| Thousands of users, distributed system | Token bucket + Redis (atomic ops) |

